<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-INSIGHT - Australia Gold Index oversold, seen turning up.</title>
<headline>RTRS-INSIGHT - Australia Gold Index oversold, seen turning up.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Gold Index has fallen through support, but has staged a recovery to finish above support.</p>
</text>
